  "dependency-notes": {
    "vite-electron-plugin": "upgrade from 12 to 14 broke because they apparently don't support node in renderer anymore",
    "vite-plugin-electron-renderer": "1.0.0 (tried 2026-10) builds, but under vite-plus 1.3.0 its build-time transform never runs on our modules, so dist/index-*.js keeps bare `import ... from \"electron\"` and node builtins, and the window never renders. 1.0 also drops the nodeIntegration and optimizeDeps options and stops setting build.assetsDir to \"\" and the CJS output format.",
    "react-dropzone": "They broke electron in 14.3.0 https://github.com/react-dropzone/react-dropzone/issues/1411"
